# [SRV6OPS](../wg/srv6ops.html)

## Summary

The SRV6OPS Working Group session featured three real-world operator presentations detailing SRv6 deployments in large-scale AI clusters and enterprise WAN backbones, followed by status updates and technical discussions on working group and individual drafts. Key focus areas included source routing for AI data center load balancing, static routing versus dynamic routing in massive supercomputing clusters, addressing recommendations, network protection mechanisms, BFD encapsulation, and gateway interworking options.

