### Working Group Drafts

#### [3.1 Deployment Options](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-srv6ops-31-deployment-options-00)
- **Draft**: `draft-ietf-srv6ops-srv6-deployment`
- **Updates**: Incorporated feedback from BESS WG regarding EVPN-VXLAN to SRv6 migration, including details on BGP VPN control planes, local preference manipulation during migration steps, and service layer gateways.
- **Status**: The authors consider the draft nearly ready for Working Group Last Call (WGLC).

#### [3.2 Addressing Recommendations](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-srv6ops-32-addressing-recommendations-00)
- **Draft**: `draft-ietf-srv6ops-srv6addressing`
- **Presenter**: Martin Horneffer
- **Updates**: Version -01 published post-adoption. Clarified subdomains as independent domains within an organization.
- **Open Issues**: Resolving ULA prefix limitations (`/48` standard vs. `/32` or shorter SRv6 allocation needs), global uniqueness across organizations, and expansion strategies. Target WGLC by next IETF meeting.

